sequenceDiagram
    participant "GitHub Actions" as GitHubActions
    participant "AWS CloudFormation" as AWSCloudFormation
    participant "AWS CloudWatch" as AWSCloudWatch
    participant "Public Status Page Service" as PublicStatusPageService
    participant "Team Notification Service" as TeamNotificationService

    activate AWSCloudFormation
    GitHubActions->>AWSCloudFormation: 1. Executes 'npx aws-cdk deploy ReadTrackProdStack --require-approval never' for new version (v1.1.0)
    AWSCloudFormation-->>GitHubActions: Deployment in progress...
    AWSCloudFormation->>GitHubActions: 2. Deployment v1.1.0 completes
    AWSCloudWatch->>TeamNotificationService: 3. Fires alarm: 'API_5xx_Error_Rate_High' state changes to ALARM
    activate AWSCloudWatch
    GitHubActions->>AWSCloudWatch: 4. Post-deployment step: Polls for alarm state for 5 minutes
    AWSCloudWatch-->>GitHubActions: Alarm State: 'ALARM'
    GitHubActions->>GitHubActions: 5. Detects failure status and triggers 'on-failure' rollback job
    GitHubActions->>PublicStatusPageService: 6. POST /api/incidents - Create incident: 'Investigating issues with a recent deployment.'
    PublicStatusPageService-->>GitHubActions: 201 Created { incidentId: 'inc-123' }
    GitHubActions->>AWSCloudFormation: 7. Executes 'cdk deploy' for previous stable version (v1.0.0)
    AWSCloudFormation-->>GitHubActions: Rollback deployment in progress...
    AWSCloudFormation->>GitHubActions: 8. Rollback to v1.0.0 completes successfully
    GitHubActions->>PublicStatusPageService: 9. PATCH /api/incidents/inc-123 - Update incident status to 'resolved'
    PublicStatusPageService-->>GitHubActions: 200 OK
    GitHubActions->>TeamNotificationService: 10. Posts message: 'CRITICAL: Production deployment v1.1.0 failed and was automatically rolled back to v1.0.0.'

    note over GitHubActions: The 'failure' trigger is critical. It's not just a failed command, but a semantic failure detecte...
    note over AWSCloudFormation: The rollback mechanism relies on the immutability of git tags to ensure the exact code of the pre...

    deactivate AWSCloudWatch
    deactivate AWSCloudFormation
